---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us" description="About Finance Hub.">
  <main class="container">
    <h1>About Finance Hub</h1>
    <p>Welcome to Finance Hub. We are a team of Mechanical and Production Engineers who love mathematics, software development, and personal finance.</p>
    <p>We realized that the internet was full of slow, cluttered financial websites that overwhelm users with pop-ups and confusing information. We built Finance Hub to solve that problem.</p>
    <p>Our calculators are built using modern, lightweight web technology (Astro) to ensure they load instantly on any device. Every formula is rigorously tested for accuracy by our engineering team.</p>
    <p>Whether you are a freelancer calculating your tax burden or a homeowner estimating a mortgage, our tools are designed to give you fast, reliable answers. No fluff, just math.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
  h1 { border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; }
  p { margin-bottom: 16px; }
</style>
